# Integration test files that keep a binary of their own (ADR-0030 X2): each
# owns process-global state, so the process boundary is its isolation.
# `<path> <reason>`, checked by scripts/check-test-layout.sh in `just test`.
crates/b2bua/tests/hydration_trace_adoption.rs installs the process trace registry
crates/b2bua/tests/trace_alloc_budget.rs installs the global allocation counter
crates/b2bua-harness/tests/per_call_trace.rs installs the process trace registry
crates/b2bua-harness/tests/trace_enforced_transition.rs installs the process trace registry
crates/b2bua-harness/tests/trace_failover_force_enable.rs installs the process trace registry
crates/b2bua-harness/tests/trace_force_enable.rs installs the process trace registry
crates/b2bua-harness/tests/trace_wire_fidelity.rs installs the process trace registry
crates/b2bua-runner-kit/tests/cdr_rabbitmq_io_threads.rs counts every thread of the process
crates/failover-harness/tests/takeover_linked_span.rs installs the process trace registry
crates/jemalloc-stats/tests/footprint.rs installs jemalloc as the global allocator
crates/media/tests/rtp_media_live.rs real UDP paced by the wall clock, frame count wants an idle process
crates/scenario-harness/tests/artifact_on_drop.rs sets and removes a process environment variable
crates/sip-message/tests/alloc_budget.rs installs the global allocation counter
crates/sip-proxy/tests/trace_alloc_budget.rs installs the global allocation counter
